    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "•drought",
      "PAA\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS\nLATIN AMERICAN DIVISION - BOLIVAR, 21 — MEXICQ, D. F.\nOFFICE OF\nF. S. ADAMS\nDecember 16, 1946\nCot. Sharron\nPAA Sr. Pilot\nMunicipal Airport\nBrownsvilk, Texas\nDear Captain:\nI am sending you herewith a set of the\npictures taken\nat the inauguration of the,:\nnew international wing to the Mexico City\nairport. Neither Mr. Rojas nor his staff\n• have been able to locate any of the pic-\ntures of the DO 4 to which you referred\nin your last conversation.\nMr. Rojas is\nunder the impression that those pictures\nmust not have been taken by his department.\nIf you can give me any more informa-\ntion, I shall be glad to try and run them\ndown\nIor you.\nWarm personal regards.\nI. S. Adams —\nencs.",
